course: dictionary
lesson: 10501
title: Twelfth: position and part
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Twelfth is a number word that shows position in a line. It comes after eleventh, and it is number 12 in order. «On the twelfth month of every year it shall grow soft again» means the twelfth month, the one after the eleventh.
explain: Twelfth can also be a fraction: one of twelve equal parts of a whole, written 1/12. The plural is twelfths. Think of cutting a cake into twelve equal slices: one slice is a twelfth of the cake.
explain: To find one twelfth of a total, divide by 12. «One worker makes only about a twelfth of a teaspoon of honey in her whole life» means the work is shared into twelve equal parts, and one worker's share is one of them.
fact: Twelfth is the number 12 in order: first, second, and so on, up to eleventh, then twelfth.
fact: A twelfth is one of twelve equal parts of a whole, written 1/12.
fact: A month is one twelfth of a year, because a year has twelve months.
fact: To find one twelfth of a number, divide it by 12.
fact: Twelfth Night is a play by Shakespeare, and twelfth grade is the last year of school in the US.
exercise: Which number comes twelfth in order? | 21 | 11 | *12 | 2
exercise: A month is one ____ of a year. | *one twelfth | one tenth | twelve | one half
exercise: A cake is cut into twelve equal slices. How many slices is one twelfth of the cake? | Six slices | Two slices | *One slice | Twelve slices
test: What is one twelfth of 36? | 24 | 6 | *3 | 12
test: Which word comes straight after eleventh in order? | Thirteenth | *Twelfth | Twelve | Tenth
exam: Three months of the year is what fraction of the whole year? | one twelfth | twelve threes | three tenths | *three twelfths
